<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have deployed troops to the Kataib Hezbollah stronghold of Jurf al-Sakhar and to Jurf al-Nasr as the prime minister Al-Zaidi orders an inquiry into oil smuggling and threatens force to enforce a deadline for militia withdrawal. Kataib Hezbollah denies involvement in the smuggling probe, calling it a lie and accusing the government of yielding to external pressure. Jordan and Iraq have jointly blocked Telegram over national security concerns. The government has arrested five people for impersonating a prosecutor. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNeUlTdkFxaWpmd0tNUXA5WXRMbmQydm9xVGtYVXYwbnAxVWx3QnZfOUdJS2YwUkFmRWV3TkRHclFKdEZzcFlKLUlGSXhQQ1VBZUFENE9pSWdzRHBsYzg1QVA5am4weVVXeUJHZzF3OGZuVnZ6dmZlbmxUZExnREs4NEMwUFFFMGRsN2N4VThtbUZFS21hblF2bXEzQk5pR3k4SDJBZVhLTDEtT0V3UHN0dnRpWkZKNEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1iNmVhWG9MeTNkbFhMNGtWU3ZKbWxXbFhrRXlrUGhHcE5YZXE0YlFyNWo4ZmMxVVFzcDFmT09HWEZPUklJbC1ZN0JGTmMtNlE3S1liTkdlYVRXZ1RMd0ZHVWNkY1MzUG8xQ1dSS2F0alVRVjRib0Qw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kuwait Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQSEJaR0pQLTdmTTNoSlp5TTBHQmM3bHNuREVWc0lTaTNGNE5xU1p4SVM5eEpkNkFlajBpSEtyR3NGb1B3aHRnOGpoRXlnc0N6XzU2eHhGOHF4OU41WVVPa1RZZElOWXEzSUhUZ1ZGVnVJY20zc0dqdHczSlJRV2lUV0pLWUU5bWhDVjR5TDE2dG5BdzA2RnItTnpwY2NSN2loV243dmFGVlhxZWZKekdVYy1hUXpMM0hIWlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Qatar news age